# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

conf/servers.json is configuration, not seed. It is bind-mounted read-only at
/pgadmin4/servers.json and read by pgAdmin at startup to pre-register the
connection; pgAdmin never writes to it, and the pgadmin-data volume holds the
user state it does write.
